    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aStar Odyssey\u300b is a strategy pigeon game where you control planets, destroy monsters, challenge bosses, buy power-ups, and survive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the Workshop to design characters, monsters, and props!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced (less than 20 minutes per game), auto-save games, and start a game anytime, anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of planets to choose from, and various mechanics are waiting for you to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of props for you to choose from, props can be freely combined and linked to form a powerful build (shield flow, escape flow, anti-injury flow, charm flow, special effect flow)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave of enemy attacks lasts for 20~60 seconds, and the game rhythm is relaxed and entertaining!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy monsters to pick up coins, and open random shops to buy items at any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of unique monsters, bosses, and emergencies make every game a unique experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of difficulties are available to challenge, and the amount of play is full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the Workshop to design characters, monsters, and props!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At last:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported this game</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aStar Odyssey\u300b is a strategy pigeon game where you control planets, destroy monsters, challenge bosses, buy power-ups, and survive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the Workshop to design characters, monsters, and props!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced (less than 20 minutes per game), auto-save games, and start a game anytime, anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of planets to choose from, and various mechanics are waiting for you to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of props for you to choose from, props can be freely combined and linked to form a powerful build (shield flow, escape flow, anti-injury flow, charm flow, special effect flow)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave of enemy attacks lasts for 20~60 seconds, and the game rhythm is relaxed and entertaining!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy monsters to pick up coins, and open random shops to buy items at any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of unique monsters, bosses, and emergencies make every game a unique experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of difficulties are available to challenge, and the amount of play is full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the Workshop to design characters, monsters, and props!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At last:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported this game</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aStar Odyssey\u300b is a 2D strategy space shooter Roguelike game in which you play as a planet in the universe, choose a variety of props with different effects, progress, build unique builds, and survive and conquer in the interstellar arena with wits and courage.",
